<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Europol Case File | Confidential Review</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap CDN framework for clean box grid alignments -->
    <link href="https://jsdelivr.net" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --europol-navy: #090e3a; 
            --europol-bright: #0053ff; 
            --europol-gold: #ffd200;
            --danger-red: #cf304a; 
        }
        body { background-color: #f8fafc; color: #111827; font-family: "Open Sans", sans-serif; }
        header { background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; height: 75px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 5%; }
        .logo-block { background-color: var(--europol-bright); color: #ffffff; font-weight: 900; padding: 12px 25px; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; font-size: 20px; }
        .hero-banner { background-color: var(--europol-navy); color: #ffffff; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--europol-gold); }
        
        /* Secure Enclosed Box Styling */
        .page-box { background: white; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 35px; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
        .profile-img-placeholder { background-color: #f1f5f9; border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; color: #64748b; height: 220px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        
        .warrant-tag { background-color: var(--danger-red); color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; display: inline-block; }
        .meta-label { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .meta-value { font-size: 15px; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        
        .section-subheading { color: var(--europol-navy); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .list-item-custom { font-size: 13.5px; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        
        footer { background-color: var(--europol-navy); color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; padding: 20px 0; text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- --- NAVIGATION HEADER --- -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo-block" onclick="window.location.href='index.html'">Europol</div>
        <div class="d-flex">
            <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary fw-bold px-3">Return to Main List</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- --- HEADER HERO BANNER --- -->
    <section class="hero-banner">
        <h1 class="fw-bold h4 m-0">Europol Case File System</h1>
        <p class="small text-white-50 m-0 mt-1">Classification: Confidential / Investigative Action Pending</p>
    </section>

    <!-- --- MAIN CONTAINER (ALL CONTENTS ENCLOSED INSIDE THE BOX) --- -->
    <div class="container my-5">
        <div class="page-box">
            
            <!-- Document Control Metadata Row -->
            <div class="row border-bottom pb-3 mb-4 align-items-center">
                <div class="col-sm-6">
                    <span class="warrant-tag">Active Red Notice</span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6 text-sm-end mt-2 mt-sm-0 small text-muted">
                    <div><strong>Case Number:</strong> EC3-AML-2026-784291-EU</div>
                    <div><strong>Date Opened:</strong> 27 May 2026</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                    <div class="profile-img-placeholder mb-3">[ Subject Photograph Deck ]</div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="meta-label">Subject Identity</div>
                            <div class="meta-value">BRANKO MILOS</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="meta-label">Target Country Location</div>
                            <div class="meta-value">CROATIA</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="meta-label">Registered Phone Number</div>
                            <div class="meta-value">+385998598878</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="meta-label">Date of Birth</div>
                            <div class="meta-value">16.08.1997</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="meta-label">Nationality</div>
                            <div class="meta-value">CROATIAN</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="meta-label">Gender Classification</div>
                            <div class="meta-value">MALE</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Descriptive Text Boxes Layout (Still inside the main page-box boundary) -->
            <div class="row mt-2">
                <div class="col-12">
                    
                    <div class="section-subheading">Case Summary Documentation</div>
                    <p class="small text-muted text-justify lh-base mb-3">Following multiple reports connected to alleged fraud and cyber-related activities, authorities initiated a review concerning possible financial facilitation, communication support, and coordination linked to suspected scam operations.</p>
                    <p class="small text-muted text-justify lh-base mb-3">According to gathered intelligence and submitted materials, the subject allegedly maintained communication with individuals connected to organized online fraud networks and may have assisted activities involving movement of funds, concealment of digital assets, and online coordination.</p>
                    <p class="small text-muted text-justify lh-base mb-3">According to submitted statements and communications, the subject allegedly expressed support toward individuals connected to fraud-related activities in the Philippines instead of cooperating with AML-related concerns. These statements were included as part of the reported communications and remain subject to verification and investigative review.</p>

                    <div class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="section-subheading">Investigative Review Parameters</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Financial transaction activity tracing logs</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Communication records and encrypted messages</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Linked online accounts and cryptocurrency wallets</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Cross-border digital activity footprints</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Screenshots and electronic evidence files</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="section-subheading">Potential Offenses Under Evaluation</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Transnational Corporate Cybercrime & Fraud</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Money Laundering & Heavy AML Violations</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Conspiracy / Facilitation to Defraud Networks</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Organized Syndicate Scam Field Operations</div>
                            <div class="list-item-custom">• Financial Support Infrastructure Deployment</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-subheading">Associated Forensic Locations & Links</div>
                    <p class="small text-muted m-0">• Target Core Channels: Philippines (Reported Connections) | Croatia Residence</p>
                    <p class="small text-muted mb-3">• Media Injects: Online platforms, encrypted messaging applications, cryptocurrency wallets registries</p>

                    <div class="section-subheading">Administrative Regulatory Notes</div>
                    <p class="small text-muted text-justify m-0">The case materials were documented for investigative assessment and verification through the appropriate cybercrime and AML review procedures. Further action remains subject to evidence validation and investigative findings.</p>

                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Outbound Return Triggers inside the enclosure box parameters -->
            <div class="text-center mt-4 pt-3 border-top">
                <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm px-4 fw-bold">&lt; Return to Intelligence Registry Overview</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- --- FOOTER --- -->
    <footer>&copy; 2026 Europol Cyber Intelligence Hub. Confidential System Architecture.</footer>
</body>
</html>
